      "gen": "schools-sup"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "One Richmond school publishes its catchment as streets: Hugh McRoberts Secondary's page describes it as running from No. 3 Road and Francis Road east along Francis Road to Garden City Road, south to Williams Road, east to No. 4 Road, south to Steveston Highway and back west to No. 3 Road, in the version dated July 1, 1997. Confirm any address with the district locator, since catchments change.",
