    {
      "q": "How many schools are in Richmond, BC?",
      "a": "The BC Ministry of Education and Child Care list shows 69 schools with a Richmond street address: 53 public schools and 16 independent schools. The count includes alternate programs and online schools that have a street address."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which school district covers Richmond?",
      "a": "Public schools with a Richmond address are run by School District 38 (Richmond) and School District 93 (Conseil scolaire francophone)."
    },
    {
      "q": "How do I find the catchment school for a Richmond address?",
      "a": "Ask School District 38 (Richmond) and School District 93 (Conseil scolaire francophone) to confirm it for the exact street address."
    },
